---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="A little about Ben and this blog.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Ben. This is my corner of the internet — a place to write down
      what I'm working on, share things I've figured out, and keep notes I'll
      probably want again later.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Astro</a>,
      a fast framework for content-focused websites, and it's hosted for free on
      GitHub Pages. Every time I push a change, it redeploys automatically.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Notes on projects I'm building</li>
      <li>Things I learn about code and tools</li>
      <li>The occasional longer write-up</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Thanks for stopping by.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
